      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(...)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6e6ea7e1675130fe"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Crayon Drawing: On the dock, a little blue figure hauls a giant fish from the water. Nearby, a little red figure stares up at a massive beetle in midair, with a windmill and golden wheat fields behind them.]"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-2c53ae863fb828df"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Today, I spotted a beetle with the most amazing markings, but before I could get a closer look, that idiot Piso scared it away, yelling like crazy."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-0ee4cee39797def4"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Just because he caught a big fish... alas... Boys his age are seriously so immature."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3cb7c0f652dbacdf"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(A number of pages are skipped.)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-21dc0750bf71f3b6"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Crayon Drawing: A golden lion, looking part cat and part dog, lies lazily on the ground. A little red figure reaches out to pet its soft, fluffy fur.]"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-ab24c16c949d317a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Today, I found a picture of a lion in a book! It looked so beautiful. I really wish I could pet one someday... or even better, have one as a pet!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-8261f61e1f6364c4"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I heard that in the holy city of Okhema, there are lions who can talk and are exceptionally clever. I really want to go chat with them!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-d2a544eb3c5ada27"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(A number of pages are skipped.)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-21dc0750bf71f3b6-2"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Crayon Drawing: A pink figure, backpack almost bigger than herself, stands beside a giant gift box. In the background: simple sketches of houses, a windmill, and golden wheat fields.]"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b612b41d9e042790"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Cyrene is about to leave the village on her big adventure. She promised me that if she has the chance, she'll visit the little lions of Okhema for me~"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-c30ac69f9713858b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I also want to go with her, but I'm still too young now... So for now, I'll let my small gifts accompany her in my place."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-f6d862a3081a2b70"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(A number of pages are skipped.)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-21dc0750bf71f3b6-3"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Crayon Drawing: A pink figure with a huge bow on her head. The background is blurred and smudged, as if soaked through by water.]"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-2e81710937539c6b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Lately, I have been reading tons of books, and I discovered there are soooo many amazing places out there! Like... (the rest of the words are blurred and unreadable.)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-48ccdc62ad300fc1"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(A number of pages are skipped.)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-21dc0750bf71f3b6-4"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Crayon Drawing: A little red figure stands in the center, surrounded by books, quill pens, branches, butterflies, and a great big question mark overhead.]"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-7973216c1f2b7cef"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "My tenth birthday is almost here! And after that, I won't be just a little kid anymore. It's time to start planning my future!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-2df3dd032242e3e0"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I want to become a teacher like mama, but I also want to roam all across Amphoreus, just like Cyrene... Ahh! It's so hard to decide! Maybe I should just become a bard instead!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-a921c44fe1d92c69"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(...)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6e6ea7e1675130fe-2"
          },
          {
